   "title": "第55回館林まつり 2026.7.18-19",
   "html": "<p><a href=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260525231941.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"image-set\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-46884 size-medium\" src=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260525231941-283x400.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"283\" height=\"400\" srcset=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260525231941-283x400.jpg 283w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260525231941-320x453.jpg 320w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/20260525231941.jpg 707w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 283px) 100vw, 283px\" /></a></p>\n<h2>第55回館林まつり</h2>\n<h3>日時</h3>\n<p>2026年7月18日(土)・19日(日)</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>前夜祭 18日(土) 16:00-21:00</li>\n<li>本まつり 19日(日) 15:00-21:00</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>会場</h3>\n<p>本町通り(中央通り)など</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-02.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"image-set\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-47576\" src=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-02.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1360\" height=\"1569\" srcset=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-02.jpg 1360w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-02-347x400.jpg 347w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-02-1179x1360.jpg 1179w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-02-768x886.jpg 768w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-02-1331x1536.jpg 1331w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-02-320x369.jpg 320w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\" /></a></p>\n<h3>内容</h3>\n<p>民踊流し、パレード、みこし、八木節、ダンスほか</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-03.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"image-set\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-47575\" src=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-03.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1360\" height=\"1871\" srcset=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-03.jpg 1360w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-03-291x400.jpg 291w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-03-989x1360.jpg 989w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-03-768x1057.jpg 768w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-03-1116x1536.jpg 1116w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/event-tatebayashi-20260718_19-03-320x440.jpg 320w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1360px) 100vw, 1360px\" /></a></p>\n<h3>駐車場</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>館林市役所駐車場（館林市城町1-1）</li>\n<li>三の丸南面駐車場（館林市城町1）</li>\n<li>市民センター駐車場（館林市仲町14-1）</li>\n<li>尾曳駐車場（館林市尾曳町9）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>神輿担ぎ手募集</h3>\n<p>館林青年会議所が一緒に神輿を担ぐ仲間を募集しています。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260630144228.jpg\" data-lightbox=\"image-set\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-47581\" src=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260630144228-400x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260630144228-400x225.jpg 400w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260630144228-768x432.jpg 768w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260630144228-320x180.jpg 320w, https://tatebayashi.info/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/20260630144228.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" /></a></p>\n<p>日時は7月19日(日)15:40-18:40 詳細 ⇒ <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jcitatebayashi/p/DaMcIpBiePK/\" target=\"_blank\">【第55回 館林まつり】 で、一緒に神輿を担ぐ熱い仲間を大募集！</a></p>\n<p>参加希望の方は<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jcitatebayashi/\" target=\"_blank\">館林青年会議所Instagram</a>までDMしてください。</p>\n<h3>リンク</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.city.tatebayashi.gunma.jp/s059/kanko/020/20210506113415.html\">第55回館林まつり・第27回館林手筒花火大会開催｜館林市</a></p>\n<h3>注意事項</h3>\n<p>上記内容は確認の上記載していますが、誤りなどある場合がございます。また、イベントは日時内容など変更になる場合があります。参加される際には必ず主催者からの情報を確認してください。</p>\n"
  },
